{"id":"00edfc475b2c29b1","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-algebraic-computation-tree.md","title":"Algebraic Computation Trees over the Reals","display":"df-algebraic-computation-tree — Algebraic Computation Trees over the Reals","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-algebraic-computation-tree","aliases":["28-df-algebraic-computation-tree"],"display":"df-algebraic-computation-tree — Algebraic Computation Trees over the Reals","depends_on":[],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definitions 16.15–16.16; explicit real-constant and reachable-cost extension","source_printed_pages":"327","source_pdf_pages":"353","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false,"verification_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-algebraic-computation-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-algebraic-computation-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-algebraic-computation-tree — Algebraic Computation Trees over the Reals"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definitions 16.15–16.16; explicit real-constant and reachable-cost extension"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"327"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"353"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\prec g\">\\(h\\prec g\\)</span> 表示真前缀，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\">\\(\\epsilon\\)</span> 为空串。候选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 是有限非空前缀闭二进制地址集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> 为定义域是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的标签函数；不同标签构造互异。</li>\n<li>标签 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(0,b)\">\\((0,b)\\)</span> 为输出叶；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(1,\\circ,u,v)\">\\((1,\\circ,u,v)\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circ\\in\\{+,−,\\times,\\div\\}\">\\(\\circ\\in\\{+,−,\\times,\\div\\}\\)</span> 的算术节点；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(2,u)\">\\((2,u)\\)</span> 为实主平方根节点；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(3,\\triangle,u)\">\\((3,\\triangle,u)\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\triangle\\in\\{=,\\ge,\\le\\}\">\\(\\triangle\\in\\{=,\\ge,\\le\\}\\)</span> 的测试节点。引用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(0,i),(1,g),(2,a)\">\\((0,i),(1,g),(2,a)\\)</span> 分别指输入坐标、祖先计算节点、实常量。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathbb R^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(f:\\mathbb R^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathbb R^n\">\\(x\\in\\mathbb R^n\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s[h\\mapsto z]\">\\(s[h\\mapsto z]\\)</span> 为映射的单点更新。配置集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathscr C_{T,\\tau}\">\\(\\mathscr C_{T,\\tau}\\)</span>、合法引用集和求值均由下式定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_{x,s}(u)\">\\(v_{x,s}(u)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Step}_{T,\\tau,x}\">\\(\\operatorname{Step}_{T,\\tau,x}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Paths}_{T,\\tau}(x)\">\\(\\operatorname{Paths}_{T,\\tau}(x)\\)</span> 只对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(T,\\tau)\\in\\mathscr S_n\">\\((T,\\tau)\\in\\mathscr S_n\\)</span> 定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c=(h,s),c&#39;=(h&#39;,s&#39;)\\in\\mathscr C_{T,\\tau}\">\\(c=(h,s),c&#39;=(h&#39;,s&#39;)\\in\\mathscr C_{T,\\tau}\\)</span>，引用调用域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in\\mathcal R_{T,\\tau,h}\">\\(u\\in\\mathcal R_{T,\\tau,h}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{acost}((T,\\tau),x)\">\\(\\operatorname{acost}((T,\\tau),x)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell_{T,\\tau}(x)\">\\(\\ell_{T,\\tau}(x)\\)</span> 只对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(T,\\tau)\\in\\mathscr A_n\">\\((T,\\tau)\\in\\mathscr A_n\\)</span> 定义，使用其唯一完整路径。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\min\\varnothing=+\\infty\">\\(\\min\\varnothing=+\\infty\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Succ}_T(h)\\coloneqq\\{b\\in\\Sigma:hb\\in T\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{Calc}_\\tau(g)\\leftrightarrow\\bigl(\\exists u,v,\\circ\\ \\tau(g)=(1,\\circ,u,v)\\bigr)\\lor\\bigl(\\exists u\\ \\tau(g)=(2,u)\\bigr)\\quad(g\\in T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Succ}_T(h)\\coloneqq\\{b\\in\\Sigma:hb\\in T\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{Calc}_\\tau(g)\\leftrightarrow\\bigl(\\exists u,v,\\circ\\ \\tau(g)=(1,\\circ,u,v)\\bigr)\\lor\\bigl(\\exists u\\ \\tau(g)=(2,u)\\bigr)\\quad(g\\in T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_{T,\\tau,h}\\coloneqq\\{(0,i):i\\in[n]\\}\\cup\\{(1,g):g\\in T,\\ g\\prec h,\\ \\operatorname{Calc}_\\tau(g)\\}\\cup\\{(2,a):a\\in\\mathbb R\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal R_{T,\\tau,h}\\coloneqq\\{(0,i):i\\in[n]\\}\\cup\\{(1,g):g\\in T,\\ g\\prec h,\\ \\operatorname{Calc}_\\tau(g)\\}\\cup\\{(2,a):a\\in\\mathbb R\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathscr S_n\\coloneqq\\{(T,\\tau):\\;&amp;T\\subseteq\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega},\\ |T|&lt;\\aleph_0,\\ \\epsilon\\in T,\\ \\forall g\\in T\\ \\forall h\\preceq g\\ h\\in T,\\ \\operatorname{dom}(\\tau)=T,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall h\\in T\\ [ (\\exists b\\in\\Sigma\\ \\tau(h)=(0,b)\\land\\operatorname{Succ}_T(h)=\\varnothing)\\\\\n&amp;\\lor(\\exists\\circ\\in\\{+,−,\\times,\\div\\}\\ \\exists u,v\\in\\mathcal R_{T,\\tau,h}\\ \\tau(h)=(1,\\circ,u,v)\\land\\operatorname{Succ}_T(h)=\\{0\\})\\\\\n&amp;\\lor(\\exists u\\in\\mathcal R_{T,\\tau,h}\\ \\tau(h)=(2,u)\\land\\operatorname{Succ}_T(h)=\\{0\\})\\\\\n&amp;\\lor(\\exists\\triangle\\in\\{=,\\ge,\\le\\}\\ \\exists u\\in\\mathcal R_{T,\\tau,h}\\ \\tau(h)=(3,\\triangle,u)\\land\\operatorname{Succ}_T(h)=\\{0,1\\})]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathscr S_n\\coloneqq\\{(T,\\tau):\\;&amp;T\\subseteq\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega},\\ |T|&lt;\\aleph_0,\\ \\epsilon\\in T,\\ \\forall g\\in T\\ \\forall h\\preceq g\\ h\\in T,\\ \\operatorname{dom}(\\tau)=T,\\\\\n&amp;\\forall h\\in T\\ [ (\\exists b\\in\\Sigma\\ \\tau(h)=(0,b)\\land\\operatorname{Succ}_T(h)=\\varnothing)\\\\\n&amp;\\lor(\\exists\\circ\\in\\{+,−,\\times,\\div\\}\\ \\exists u,v\\in\\mathcal R_{T,\\tau,h}\\ \\tau(h)=(1,\\circ,u,v)\\land\\operatorname{Succ}_T(h)=\\{0\\})\\\\\n&amp;\\lor(\\exists u\\in\\mathcal R_{T,\\tau,h}\\ \\tau(h)=(2,u)\\land\\operatorname{Succ}_T(h)=\\{0\\})\\\\\n&amp;\\lor(\\exists\\triangle\\in\\{=,\\ge,\\le\\}\\ \\exists u\\in\\mathcal R_{T,\\tau,h}\\ \\tau(h)=(3,\\triangle,u)\\land\\operatorname{Succ}_T(h)=\\{0,1\\})]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathscr C_{T,\\tau}\\coloneqq\\{(h,s):h\\in T,\\ s\\in\\mathbb R^{\\{g\\in T:g\\prec h\\land\\operatorname{Calc}_\\tau(g)\\}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathscr C_{T,\\tau}\\coloneqq\\{(h,s):h\\in T,\\ s\\in\\mathbb R^{\\{g\\in T:g\\prec h\\land\\operatorname{Calc}_\\tau(g)\\}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"v_{x,s}(u)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}x_i&amp;u=(0,i),\\\\s(g)&amp;u=(1,g),\\\\a&amp;u=(2,a).\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[v_{x,s}(u)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}x_i&amp;u=(0,i),\\\\s(g)&amp;u=(1,g),\\\\a&amp;u=(2,a).\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Step}_{T,\\tau,x}(c,c&#39;)\\leftrightarrow&amp;\\ \\exists u,v\\in\\mathcal R_{T,\\tau,h}\\ \\exists z\\in\\mathbb R\\ \\exists\\circ\\in\\{+,−,\\times,\\div\\}\\ [\\tau(h)=(1,\\circ,u,v)\\land h&#39;=h0\\land s&#39;=s[h\\mapsto z]\\\\\n&amp;\\land((\\circ=+\\land z=v_{x,s}(u)+v_{x,s}(v))\\lor(\\circ=−\\land z=v_{x,s}(u)-v_{x,s}(v))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\lor(\\circ=\\times\\land z=v_{x,s}(u)v_{x,s}(v))\\lor(\\circ=\\div\\land v_{x,s}(v)\\ne0\\land z\\,v_{x,s}(v)=v_{x,s}(u)))]\\\\\n\\lor&amp;\\ \\exists u\\in\\mathcal R_{T,\\tau,h}\\ \\exists z\\in\\mathbb R\\ [\\tau(h)=(2,u)\\land z\\ge0\\land z^2=v_{x,s}(u)\\land h&#39;=h0\\land s&#39;=s[h\\mapsto z]]\\\\\n\\lor&amp;\\ \\exists u\\in\\mathcal R_{T,\\tau,h}\\ \\exists\\triangle\\in\\{=,\\ge,\\le\\}\\ [\\tau(h)=(3,\\triangle,u)\\land h&#39;=h\\mathbf1[v_{x,s}(u)\\triangle0]\\land s&#39;=s].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Step}_{T,\\tau,x}(c,c&#39;)\\leftrightarrow&amp;\\ \\exists u,v\\in\\mathcal R_{T,\\tau,h}\\ \\exists z\\in\\mathbb R\\ \\exists\\circ\\in\\{+,−,\\times,\\div\\}\\ [\\tau(h)=(1,\\circ,u,v)\\land h&#39;=h0\\land s&#39;=s[h\\mapsto z]\\\\\n&amp;\\land((\\circ=+\\land z=v_{x,s}(u)+v_{x,s}(v))\\lor(\\circ=−\\land z=v_{x,s}(u)-v_{x,s}(v))\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\lor(\\circ=\\times\\land z=v_{x,s}(u)v_{x,s}(v))\\lor(\\circ=\\div\\land v_{x,s}(v)\\ne0\\land z\\,v_{x,s}(v)=v_{x,s}(u)))]\\\\\n\\lor&amp;\\ \\exists u\\in\\mathcal R_{T,\\tau,h}\\ \\exists z\\in\\mathbb R\\ [\\tau(h)=(2,u)\\land z\\ge0\\land z^2=v_{x,s}(u)\\land h&#39;=h0\\land s&#39;=s[h\\mapsto z]]\\\\\n\\lor&amp;\\ \\exists u\\in\\mathcal R_{T,\\tau,h}\\ \\exists\\triangle\\in\\{=,\\ge,\\le\\}\\ [\\tau(h)=(3,\\triangle,u)\\land h&#39;=h\\mathbf1[v_{x,s}(u)\\triangle0]\\land s&#39;=s].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Paths}_{T,\\tau}(x)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{d\\in\\mathbb N}\\{((h_0,s_0),\\ldots,(h_d,s_d))\\in\\mathscr C_{T,\\tau}^{d+1}:(h_0,s_0)=(\\epsilon,\\varnothing),\\ \\exists b\\in\\Sigma\\ \\tau(h_d)=(0,b),\\ \\forall j&lt;d\\ \\operatorname{Step}_{T,\\tau,x}((h_j,s_j),(h_{j+1},s_{j+1}))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Paths}_{T,\\tau}(x)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{d\\in\\mathbb N}\\{((h_0,s_0),\\ldots,(h_d,s_d))\\in\\mathscr C_{T,\\tau}^{d+1}:(h_0,s_0)=(\\epsilon,\\varnothing),\\ \\exists b\\in\\Sigma\\ \\tau(h_d)=(0,b),\\ \\forall j&lt;d\\ \\operatorname{Step}_{T,\\tau,x}((h_j,s_j),(h_{j+1},s_{j+1}))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathscr A_n\\coloneqq\\{(T,\\tau)\\in\\mathscr S_n:\\forall x\\in\\mathbb R^n\\ |\\operatorname{Paths}_{T,\\tau}(x)|=1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathscr A_n\\coloneqq\\{(T,\\tau)\\in\\mathscr S_n:\\forall x\\in\\mathbb R^n\\ |\\operatorname{Paths}_{T,\\tau}(x)|=1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"w(\\ell)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}0&amp;(\\exists b\\in\\Sigma\\ \\ell=(0,b))\\lor(\\exists\\circ\\in\\{+,−\\}\\ \\exists u,v\\ \\ell=(1,\\circ,u,v)),\\\\1&amp;(\\exists\\circ\\in\\{\\times,\\div\\}\\ \\exists u,v\\ \\ell=(1,\\circ,u,v))\\lor(\\exists u\\ \\ell=(2,u))\\lor(\\exists\\triangle,u\\ \\ell=(3,\\triangle,u)).\\end{cases}\\quad(\\ell\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\tau)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[w(\\ell)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}0&amp;(\\exists b\\in\\Sigma\\ \\ell=(0,b))\\lor(\\exists\\circ\\in\\{+,−\\}\\ \\exists u,v\\ \\ell=(1,\\circ,u,v)),\\\\1&amp;(\\exists\\circ\\in\\{\\times,\\div\\}\\ \\exists u,v\\ \\ell=(1,\\circ,u,v))\\lor(\\exists u\\ \\ell=(2,u))\\lor(\\exists\\triangle,u\\ \\ell=(3,\\triangle,u)).\\end{cases}\\quad(\\ell\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\tau)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{acost}((T,\\tau),x)\\coloneqq\\sum_{j=0}^d w(\\tau(h_j)),\\qquad\\ell_{T,\\tau}(x)\\coloneqq b\\quad(((h_0,s_0),\\ldots,(h_d,s_d))\\in\\operatorname{Paths}_{T,\\tau}(x),\\ \\tau(h_d)=(0,b)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{acost}((T,\\tau),x)\\coloneqq\\sum_{j=0}^d w(\\tau(h_j)),\\qquad\\ell_{T,\\tau}(x)\\coloneqq b\\quad(((h_0,s_0),\\ldots,(h_d,s_d))\\in\\operatorname{Paths}_{T,\\tau}(x),\\ \\tau(h_d)=(0,b)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"AC(f)\\coloneqq\\min\\{\\max_{x\\in\\mathbb R^n}\\operatorname{acost}((T,\\tau),x):(T,\\tau)\\in\\mathscr A_n,\\ \\forall x\\in\\mathbb R^n\\ \\ell_{T,\\tau}(x)=f(x)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[AC(f)\\coloneqq\\min\\{\\max_{x\\in\\mathbb R^n}\\operatorname{acost}((T,\\tau),x):(T,\\tau)\\in\\mathscr A_n,\\ \\forall x\\in\\mathbb R^n\\ \\ell_{T,\\tau}(x)=f(x)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留原书加减免费、乘除开方与分支单位收费的特殊模型。到达路径上的合法性条件排除除零与负数实开方；无须要求永远到达不了的分支也合法。有限树保证终止，最大成本是有限整数范围的最大值；无可计算树时扩展值为无穷。</p>\n<p>来源：Definitions 16.15–16.16；印刷页 327；PDF 页 353。来源为本任务提供的605页本地PDF。</p>\n<p>R5新建理由：补足第16章的 Algebraic Computation Trees over the Reals，查重范围为本书目录的全部既有原子文件名、MOC及相邻相关定义全文；未读取其他书籍原子，全部声明依赖留在28目录。</p>\n<p>R5 G5专项：树/标签合法集合、引用域、操作转移、完整路径及唯一性域均已改为形式构造。权重现在作用于节点标签，未将顶点地址与门类型混比。有限树和真祖先引用保证良基性；到达除零或负数开方时没有合法路径，故不属于全输入合法树集合。</p>\n<p>R7复核：已实际对照 Definition 16.15–16.16（PDF353）：原书引用仅为输入坐标或祖先计算节点，树深度按任意根叶路径成本计。本地另允许固定实常量引用，并按输入实际到达路径的最坏成本计；这是明示扩展，不能与原书逐树深度无条件等同。本轮保留这些既有接口，并补齐转移配置及成本/输出的合法定义域；依赖本模型的下界需覆盖实常量与可达路径版本。未声称已核验所有此类下界证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"h\\prec g","display":false},{"tex":"\\epsilon","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"(0,b)","display":false},{"tex":"(1,\\circ,u,v)","display":false},{"tex":"\\circ\\in\\{+,−,\\times,\\div\\}","display":false},{"tex":"(2,u)","display":false},{"tex":"(3,\\triangle,u)","display":false},{"tex":"\\triangle\\in\\{=,\\ge,\\le\\}","display":false},{"tex":"(0,i),(1,g),(2,a)","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\mathbb R^n\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathbb R^n","display":false},{"tex":"s[h\\mapsto z]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathscr C_{T,\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"v_{x,s}(u)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Step}_{T,\\tau,x}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Paths}_{T,\\tau}(x)","display":false},{"tex":"(T,\\tau)\\in\\mathscr S_n","display":false},{"tex":"c=(h,s),c'=(h',s')\\in\\mathscr C_{T,\\tau}","display":false},{"tex":"u\\in\\mathcal R_{T,\\tau,h}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{acost}((T,\\tau),x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell_{T,\\tau}(x)","display":false},{"tex":"(T,\\tau)\\in\\mathscr A_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\min\\varnothing=+\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Succ}_T(h)\\coloneqq\\{b\\in\\Sigma:hb\\in T\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{Calc}_\\tau(g)\\leftrightarrow\\bigl(\\exists u,v,\\circ\\ \\tau(g)=(1,\\circ,u,v)\\bigr)\\lor\\bigl(\\exists u\\ \\tau(g)=(2,u)\\bigr)\\quad(g\\in T).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal R_{T,\\tau,h}\\coloneqq\\{(0,i):i\\in[n]\\}\\cup\\{(1,g):g\\in T,\\ g\\prec h,\\ \\operatorname{Calc}_\\tau(g)\\}\\cup\\{(2,a):a\\in\\mathbb R\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathscr S_n\\coloneqq\\{(T,\\tau):\\;&T\\subseteq\\Sigma^{<\\omega},\\ |T|<\\aleph_0,\\ \\epsilon\\in T,\\ \\forall g\\in T\\ \\forall h\\preceq g\\ h\\in T,\\ \\operatorname{dom}(\\tau)=T,\\\\\n&\\forall h\\in T\\ [ (\\exists b\\in\\Sigma\\ \\tau(h)=(0,b)\\land\\operatorname{Succ}_T(h)=\\varnothing)\\\\\n&\\lor(\\exists\\circ\\in\\{+,−,\\times,\\div\\}\\ \\exists u,v\\in\\mathcal R_{T,\\tau,h}\\ \\tau(h)=(1,\\circ,u,v)\\land\\operatorname{Succ}_T(h)=\\{0\\})\\\\\n&\\lor(\\exists u\\in\\mathcal R_{T,\\tau,h}\\ \\tau(h)=(2,u)\\land\\operatorname{Succ}_T(h)=\\{0\\})\\\\\n&\\lor(\\exists\\triangle\\in\\{=,\\ge,\\le\\}\\ \\exists u\\in\\mathcal R_{T,\\tau,h}\\ \\tau(h)=(3,\\triangle,u)\\land\\operatorname{Succ}_T(h)=\\{0,1\\})]\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathscr C_{T,\\tau}\\coloneqq\\{(h,s):h\\in T,\\ s\\in\\mathbb R^{\\{g\\in T:g\\prec h\\land\\operatorname{Calc}_\\tau(g)\\}}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"v_{x,s}(u)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}x_i&u=(0,i),\\\\s(g)&u=(1,g),\\\\a&u=(2,a).\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Step}_{T,\\tau,x}(c,c')\\leftrightarrow&\\ \\exists u,v\\in\\mathcal R_{T,\\tau,h}\\ \\exists z\\in\\mathbb R\\ \\exists\\circ\\in\\{+,−,\\times,\\div\\}\\ [\\tau(h)=(1,\\circ,u,v)\\land h'=h0\\land s'=s[h\\mapsto z]\\\\\n&\\land((\\circ=+\\land z=v_{x,s}(u)+v_{x,s}(v))\\lor(\\circ=−\\land z=v_{x,s}(u)-v_{x,s}(v))\\\\\n&\\qquad\\lor(\\circ=\\times\\land z=v_{x,s}(u)v_{x,s}(v))\\lor(\\circ=\\div\\land v_{x,s}(v)\\ne0\\land z\\,v_{x,s}(v)=v_{x,s}(u)))]\\\\\n\\lor&\\ \\exists u\\in\\mathcal R_{T,\\tau,h}\\ \\exists z\\in\\mathbb R\\ [\\tau(h)=(2,u)\\land z\\ge0\\land z^2=v_{x,s}(u)\\land h'=h0\\land s'=s[h\\mapsto z]]\\\\\n\\lor&\\ \\exists u\\in\\mathcal R_{T,\\tau,h}\\ \\exists\\triangle\\in\\{=,\\ge,\\le\\}\\ [\\tau(h)=(3,\\triangle,u)\\land h'=h\\mathbf1[v_{x,s}(u)\\triangle0]\\land s'=s].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Paths}_{T,\\tau}(x)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{d\\in\\mathbb N}\\{((h_0,s_0),\\ldots,(h_d,s_d))\\in\\mathscr C_{T,\\tau}^{d+1}:(h_0,s_0)=(\\epsilon,\\varnothing),\\ \\exists b\\in\\Sigma\\ \\tau(h_d)=(0,b),\\ \\forall j<d\\ \\operatorname{Step}_{T,\\tau,x}((h_j,s_j),(h_{j+1},s_{j+1}))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathscr A_n\\coloneqq\\{(T,\\tau)\\in\\mathscr S_n:\\forall x\\in\\mathbb R^n\\ |\\operatorname{Paths}_{T,\\tau}(x)|=1\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"w(\\ell)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}0&(\\exists b\\in\\Sigma\\ \\ell=(0,b))\\lor(\\exists\\circ\\in\\{+,−\\}\\ \\exists u,v\\ \\ell=(1,\\circ,u,v)),\\\\1&(\\exists\\circ\\in\\{\\times,\\div\\}\\ \\exists u,v\\ \\ell=(1,\\circ,u,v))\\lor(\\exists u\\ \\ell=(2,u))\\lor(\\exists\\triangle,u\\ \\ell=(3,\\triangle,u)).\\end{cases}\\quad(\\ell\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\tau)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{acost}((T,\\tau),x)\\coloneqq\\sum_{j=0}^d w(\\tau(h_j)),\\qquad\\ell_{T,\\tau}(x)\\coloneqq b\\quad(((h_0,s_0),\\ldots,(h_d,s_d))\\in\\operatorname{Paths}_{T,\\tau}(x),\\ \\tau(h_d)=(0,b)).","display":true},{"tex":"AC(f)\\coloneqq\\min\\{\\max_{x\\in\\mathbb R^n}\\operatorname{acost}((T,\\tau),x):(T,\\tau)\\in\\mathscr A_n,\\ \\forall x\\in\\mathbb R^n\\ \\ell_{T,\\tau}(x)=f(x)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":6418,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-358","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-arithmetic-straight-line-program]]、[[28-lem-straight-line-degree-bound]]、[[28-df-arithmetic-formula]]、[[28-df-polynomial-projection]]、[[28-df-algebraic-computation-tree]]、[[28-thm-element-distinctness-components]]、[[28-df-bss-machine]]、[[28-df-complex-bss-p-np]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}